# CLK-06 document closure source preparation

This source-only writer adapts the accepted C5 closure. The 135-line metadata
utility is byte-identical. Raw exclusively owns the C6 archive writer/verifier;
this writer consumes their genuine ignored archive0, independent verify0 and
byte-exact canonical copy. No tool is executed and no document gate is changed
by preparing these sources. Root must approve exact writer and bindings hashes
and provide actual completed evidence at execution.

## Source-review interface

`clk06-independent-closure-source-review.v1` with status
`pass-metadata-closure-source-and-proof-interface-before-document-write`.
An actual recorded metadata0 review prints its full report and supplies aware
UTC `review_started_utc`/`review_completed_utc`, `scientific_execution_performed:false`,
`executed_reader_source_archive`, and exact2 `reviewed_sources` rows containing
`historical_path`/`archive` for this `close_card.py` and `common.py`. This is a
source/provenance review, not a numerical or final-lineage execution stage.
Baseline authored the comparer, observer and earlier hourly/producer code;
other-author peer and Root's actual execution remain separate.

## Root-only future command

`python -X utf8 -B close_card.py --bindings APPROVED_JSON --bindings-sha256 ACTUAL_SHA --source-mapping APPROVED_MAPPING --card-notes APPROVED_UTF8_MD --archive ABSOLUTE_CANONICAL_ARCHIVE_JSON --archive-execution ARCHIVE_RECORDER --archive-verification-execution VERIFY_RECORDER --approved-source-sha256 HELD_WRITER_SHA --output-dir FRESH_IGNORED_OUTPUT`

The canonical archive must reside at
`energyplus_porting_plan/evidence/CLK-06-archive/archive.json`. The recorded
ignored archive and canonical copy have different paths and exact equal bytes.
Gzip/chunk objects are hashed in place and each tracked object is at most4MB.
Native results/binaries and duplicate huge stdout are not copied here.

`bindings.template.json` is deliberately pending, unauthorized and unexecutable.
It lists every consumed role without guessing future hashes or PASS. Root fills
actual refs after science/QA and final quality have completed. Source mapping
and UTF8 notes are Root-approved inputs; the mapping example names actual
pinned function definitions and explicitly limits selected hourly/subhour
blocks instead of claiming whole-function physical parity.

The writer authenticates actual candidate unit0 and unitQA0, production six CLI
